        "original_id": "8f2bb148-0125-510f-aa08-5a4e87049269",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jasmin Geljo, George A. Romero\n- Works: Cube Zero, Land of the Dead, Assault on Precinct 13, The Sentinel, Night of the Living Dead, Dawn of the Dead, Day of the Dead, Diary of the Dead, Survival of the Dead\n- Roles: Ryjkin\n- Topics: acting, horror films, Living Dead series\n\nFacts:\n- Jasmin Geljo was born on September 18, 1959.\n- Jasmin Geljo is a Bosnian-Canadian actor.\n- Jasmin Geljo is best known for playing Ryjkin in Cube Zero.\n- Jasmin Geljo is also known for roles in the films Assault on Precinct 13, Land of the Dead, and The Sentinel.\n- Land of the Dead is a 2005 post-apocalyptic horror film written and directed by George A. Romero.\n- Land of the Dead is the fourth of George A. Romero's six Living Dead films.\n- In the Living Dead series, Land of the Dead follows Night of the Living Dead, Dawn of the Dead, and Day of the Dead.\n- In the Living Dead series, Land of the Dead is followed by Diary of the Dead and Survival of the Dead.",
